  "_comment": "Measured noise floors for the layout tier (scripts/layout_loop.py floors). FROZEN: change only by explicit PR, never as a side effect of a run. An auto-updating floor tracks the regression and is worse than no floor. `corpus_*` fields describe the WORKLOAD and must never be adopted as thresholds.",
